// CDL2CROWS recognizes the Two Crows pattern over bars startIdx through endIdx.
//
// Three-candle bearish reversal pattern: a long white candle, then a black
// candle gapping up, then a black candle that opens inside the second body and
// closes down inside the first white body. A hit (-100) signals a bearish
// reversal; significant in an uptrend, which this function does not verify.
//
// Formula and more info at https://ta-lib.org/functions/cdl2crows.
//
// Inputs, each at least endIdx+1 long:
//   - inOpen: Open price of each bar.
//   - inHigh: High price of each bar.
//   - inLow: Low price of each bar.
//   - inClose: Close price of each bar.
//
// Outputs, each at least as long as the values written (the input length always
// suffices):
//   - outInteger: -100 on a detected pattern (always bearish), 0 otherwise.
//     Never emits +100.
